  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project endeavors to contribute to solutions on some specific challenges facing devolution in Kenya among them Ineffective intergovernmental relations; Ineffective county planning, public finance management and staff performance; Inadequate engagement between county governments and citizens in service delivery and limited integration of evidence, digital technology and learning as enablers of public service delivery and reform.</narrative>
  </description>
